        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "For every finite-dimensional complex evolution algebra $A$,\n$\\Der(A)\\not\\cong\\slie_3(\\C)$ as Lie algebras. Consequently\n$\\AutS(A)\\not\\cong\\mathrm{SL}_3$ as complex group schemes, and the full\nautomorphism algebraic group of $A$ is not $\\mathrm{SL}_3$.\nNo condition on $A^2$ or $\\Ann(A)$ is required.",
        "status": "preparing",
