        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "Suppose $\\Ann(A)=0$ over an algebraically closed field of characteristic\nzero. For $L=\\Der(A)$, its semisimple quotient has the form\n\\[\n L/\\rad L\\cong\\bigoplus_a\\so_{m_a}(k),\\qquad m_a\\ge3.\n\\]\nIn particular, every simple ideal of $L$ is an orthogonal simple Lie\nalgebra. Neither $\\slie_3$ nor $\\mathfrak g_2$ can be such an ideal,\nregardless of $\\dim A^2$ or whether $L$ is semisimple.",
