        "statement": "Over an algebraically closed field of characteristic zero,\n$\\Der(A)\\cong\\slie_n$ with $n\\ge2$ is possible exactly for $n=2,4$.\nOver $\\C$, the full automorphism group scheme or algebraic group of an\nevolution algebra cannot be $\\mathrm{SL}_n$ when $n=3$ or $n\\ge5$.",
